obs Prediction met measurement to the digit for the sixth lap running. Carry 71,892 -> 71,376, a fall of exactly 516; delegates 3,029 -> 3,073, exactly the forty-four stubs; bodies 18,169 -> 18,170; distinct 7,966 -> 7,967; ceiling down to 71,382.
obs The derivation held with every rung folding. Carry counts copies beyond the first, so forty-three copies times fifteen lines less a three-line stub is 516 -- the same (n-1)(k-3) the arc has used since the first lift, with n reaching every declaration for once.
obs The queue now has nothing left at zero widening. seat_note and read_words each return 504 over forty-three rungs while opening three declarations, and read_count 462 opening three. From here every lift weighs a fall against a declaration, which is a judgment this arc has not had to make until now.
obs elder_waits and door_admits return 504 and 462 while opening all forty-three, so they stay the cheapest-looking rows that cost the most.
obs No red booked this lap. REDS %132's guard held again without firing.
